sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Code
    participant Source as Source Object
    participant Dest as Destination
    participant Memory as Memory Manager

    Note over Client,Memory: Copy Semantics
    Client->>Dest: Buffer dest = source
    Dest->>Memory: allocate new buffer (deep copy)
    Memory-->>Dest: new memory block
    Dest->>Source: copy all elements
    Note over Source,Dest: O(n) allocation + copy

    Note over Client,Memory: Move Semantics
    Client->>Dest: Buffer dest = std::move(source)
    Dest->>Source: steal pointer and size
    Source->>Source: set to null / zero
    Note over Source,Dest: O(1) pointer swap

    Note over Client,Memory: Perfect Forwarding
    Client->>Dest: factory(args...)
    Dest->>Dest: forward of args...
    Note over Dest: preserves value category
    Note over Dest: lvalue to copy, rvalue to move
